# dist/ IS committed — this is a published package, consumers consume the
# pre-built artifacts. Rebuild locally with `pnpm build` after touching
# resources/js/ and commit the dist/ change in the same PR. See SECURITY.md.

# pnpm-workspace.yaml is per-developer (e.g. for local allowBuilds). We do
# not commit it because that would silently grant build-script execution to
# any future CI workflow. Local developers can create their own.
/pnpm-workspace.yaml
